iption":"basic/manual","state":"basic"},"type":{"id":"0","name":"INJURY_STATUS_ACTIVE","description":"active","abbreviation":"A"}},{"id":"645612","longComment":"Beck had been a healthy inactive through each of the Cardinals' first eight games of the season as the emergency No. 3 quarterback, but he'll get the chance to dress for the first time in Week 9 after Arizona removed the struggling Jacoby Brissett from the starting role and dropped him down two spots on the depth chart. Like Brissett, the 30-year-old Minshew is a journeyman who isn't viewed as the team's long-term solution under center, so it wouldn't be surprising if Beck eventually received a look as the starter before the end of the season if Arizona eventually fades from playoff contention. A rookie third-round pick out of Miami, Beck completed 15 of 19 pass attempts for 188 yards and a touchdown during his lone preseason appearance.","shortComment":"Head coach Mike LaFleur said that Beck will serve as the Cardinals' No. 2 quarterback behind starter Gardner Minshew in Sunday's game against the Seahawks, Darren Urban of the team's official site reports.","status":"Active","date":"2026-11-02T22:12Z","athlete":{"firstName":"Carson","lastName":"Beck","displayName":"Carson Beck","shortName":"C. Beck","links":[{"language":"en-US","rel":["playercard","desktop","athlete"],"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4430841/carson-beck","text":"Player Card","shortText":"Player Card","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["stats","desktop","athlete"],"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/stats/_/id/4430841/carson-beck","text":"Stats","shortText":"Stats","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["stats","sportscenter","app","athlete"],"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showClubhouse?uid=s:20~l:28~a:4430841&section=stats","text":"Stats","shortText":"Stats","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["splits","desktop","athlete"],"href":"http