sPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["depthchart","desktop","team"],"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/depth/_/name/ten","text":"Depth Chart","shortText":"Depth Chart","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["depthchart","sportscenter","app","team"],"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showClubhouse?uid=s:20~l:28~t:10&section=depthchart","text":"Depth Chart","shortText":"Depth Chart","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false}]},"notes":{"items":[{"id":"645504","type":"news","date":"2026-11-02T02:38Z","headline":"Robinson caught six of seven targets for 57 yards and a touchdown in Sunday's 43-36 overtime loss to the Bengals. He also lost a fumble.","text":"Robinson didn't experience a significant change in role in the absence of Carnell Tate (shoulder), as this was the fourth consecutive game in which Robinson notched either six or seven targets. His 57 receiving yards tied a season high, and Robinson scored his third touchdown of the season on a 15-yard catch in the fourth quarter. The Titans took a seven-point lead with 3:46 remaining after a successful two-point conversion following Robinson's TD, but the Bengals answered with a game-tying touchdown drive and eventually won in OT to drop the Titans to 1-7. Robinson and the Titans will be on bye in Week 9 before returning to action against the Jaguars in Week 10.","source":"RotoWire"}]},"status":{"id":"1","name":"Active","type":"active","abbreviation":"Active"}},"source":{"id":"1","description":"basic/manual","state":"basic"},"type":{"id":"0","name":"INJURY_STATUS_ACTIVE","description":"active","abbreviation":"A"}},{"id":"645440","longComment":"Ward threw two go-ahead touchdown passes in the fourth quarter, connecting with Chimere Dike for an 11-yard score before finding Wan'Dale Robinson for a 15-yard TD. Those two touchdown passes came after a streak of five Tony Pollard rushing touchdowns without a Ward passing TD over the previous seven quarters. Pollard's second rushing touchdown Sunday was followed up by a two-point conversion from Ward on the ground, and Ward threw a two-point conversion to Gunnar Helm after the touchdown pass to Robinson to take a 36-29 lead. The Bengals answered with a game-tying touchdown, and Cincinnati scored to begin overtime. Tennessee's ensuing drive in OT resulted in a turnover on downs, but the bonus possession helped Ward reach 300 passing yards in a game for the first time in his career. Ward's first multi-touchdown passing performance of the season improves his TD:INT to 6:5 heading into a Week 10 home game against the Jaguars following Tennessee's Week 9 bye.","shortComment":"Ward completed 26 of 40 passes for 304 yards and two touchdowns in Sunday's 43-36 overtime loss to the Bengals. He added seven rushing attempts for 41 yards, lost a fumble, ran in a two-point conversion and threw a successful two-point conversion.","status":"Active","date":"2026-11-01T22:40Z","athlete":{"firstName":"Cam","lastName":"Ward","displayName":"Cam Ward","shortName":"C. Ward","links":[{"language":"en-US","rel":["playercard","desktop","athlete"],"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4688380/cam-ward","text":"Player Card","shortText":"Player Card","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["stats","desktop","athlete"],"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/stats/_/id/4688380/cam-ward","text":"Stats","shortText":"Stats","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["stats","sportscenter","app","athlete"],"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showClubhouse?uid=s:20~l:28~a:4688380&section=stats","text":"Stats","shortText":"Stats","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["splits","desktop","athlete"],"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/splits/_/id/4688380/cam-ward","text":"Splits","shortText":"Splits","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["gamelog","desktop","athlete"],"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/gamelog/_/id/4688380/ca