hortText":"Injuries","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["depthchart","desktop","team"],"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/team/depth/_/name/ten","text":"Depth Chart","shortText":"Depth Chart","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["depthchart","sportscenter","app","team"],"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showClubhouse?uid=s:20~l:28~t:10&section=depthchart","text":"Depth Chart","shortText":"Depth Chart","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false}]},"notes":{"items":[{"id":"645440","type":"news","date":"2026-11-01T22:40Z","headline":"Ward completed 26 of 40 passes for 304 yards and two touchdowns in Sunday's 43-36 overtime loss to the Bengals. He added seven rushing attempts for 41 yards, lost a fumble, ran in a two-point conversion and threw a successful two-point conversion.","text":"Ward threw two go-ahead touchdown passes in the fourth quarter, connecting with Chimere Dike for an 11-yard score before finding Wan'Dale Robinson for a 15-yard TD. Those two touchdown passes came after a streak of five Tony Pollard rushing touchdowns without a Ward passing TD over the previous seven quarters. Pollard's second rushing touchdown Sunday was followed up by a two-point conversion from Ward on the ground, and Ward threw a two-point conversion to Gunnar Helm after the touchdown pass to Robinson to take a 36-29 lead. The Bengals answered with a game-tying touchdown, and Cincinnati scored to begin overtime. Tennessee's ensuing drive in OT resulted in a turnover on downs, but the bonus possession helped Ward reach 300 passing yards in a game for the first time in his career. Ward's first multi-touchdown passing performance of the season improves his TD:INT to 6:5 heading into a Week 10 home game against the Jaguars following Tennessee's Week 9 bye.","source":"RotoWire"}]},"status":{"id":"1","name":"Active","type":"active","abbreviation":"Active"}},"source":{"id":"1","description":"basic/manual","state":"basic"},"type":{"id":"0","name":"INJURY_STATUS_ACTIVE","description":"active","abbreviation":"A"}},{"id":"645438","longComment":"Pollard rumbled for a 40-yard touchdown in the first quarter and added a one-yard rushing TD in the third quarter, giving him five rushing scores in the last two games. He scored only once in the first six games of the season, but Pollard's recent hot streak has him up to six touchdowns, surpassing his total of five from each of his previous two regular seasons in Tennessee. Pollard was also brought down in Tennessee's end zone for a safety to break a 21-21 tie in the final minute of the third quarter. The surging running back has rushed for 246 yards over the past two games but could have a tough time maintaining his momentum after the Titans' Week 9 bye, as he'll return to action in a daunting Week 10 matchup against Jacksonville's league-best run defense.","shortComment":"Pollard rushed 21 times for 117 yards and two touchdowns while catching three of five targets for 20 yards in Sunday's 43-36 overtime loss to the Bengals.","status":"Active","date":"2026-11-01T22:39Z","athlete":{"firstName":"Tony","lastName":"Pollard","displayName":"Tony Pollard","shortName":"T. Pollard","links":[{"language":"en-US","rel":["playercard","desktop","athlete"],"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/3916148/tony-pollard","text":"Player Card","shortText":"Player Card","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["stats","desktop","athlete"],"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/stats/_/id/3916148/tony-pollard","text":"Stats","shortText":"Stats","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["stats","sportscenter","app","athlete"],"href":"sportscenter://x-callback-url/showClubhouse?uid=s:20~l:28~a:3916148&section=stats","text":"Stats","shortText":"Stats","isExternal":false,"isPremium":false},{"language":"en-US","rel":["splits","desktop","athlete"],"href":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/splits/_/id/3916148/tony-pollard","text":"Splits",